le sort of thing, not a blasting thing, but a bouncing. A heartbeat in the music. That's what King Oliver had in his music with Baby Dodds and Bill Johnson. They had that old New Orleans funky sound. So that's what you got. Later on, that's what musicians all over the country tried to imitate, tried to get that sound. ...", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "string"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13943$334A482B-2227-42B6-A552-8CDAC354D202", "rank": "normal"}], "P20": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P20", "hash": "4acba07c8c29a0842fa11a94df9048a80d51bcbe", "datavalue": {"value": "https://semlab.s3.amazonaws.com/texts/eb031d08a1a7e4523782556da91b06a1/377.txt", "type": "string"}, "datatype": "url"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13943$D3606F64-8B54-42B4-B62A-EE19DEA272B9", "rank": "normal"}], "P21": [{"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "1c334de6349e1ab27c5d27e7633ab548c54ce2b5", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1239, "id": "Q1239"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13943$31E66797-3761-499E-AF2C-3A85326CD890", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "33d00f9e62a518cceaec7a3c559620c6582d8070", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 1367, "id": "Q1367"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13943$38FBC5BA-1DDA-4066-803D-989DC75C0D7B", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "80a818e6c7afe99327e1e024af57f01bef25b009", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "numeric-id": 190, "id": "Q190"}, "type": "wikibase-entityid"}, "datatype": "wikibase-item"}, "type": "statement", "id": "Q13943$B7772083-3E2A-4C7D-8A02-2E195C42BA99", "rank": "normal"}, {"mainsnak": {"snaktype": "value", "property": "P21", "hash": "1fcbe008b7e68d0ae3082395ec7e4aa7b7a86fe0", "datavalue": {"value": {"entity-type": "item", "